  },
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the sum of all the elements of the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to ________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "832",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">N</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8739;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mn>97</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>97</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>97</mn></math></p><p>Clearly, the terms are in arithmetic progression. Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>97</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>97</mn></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is the number of terms.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>97</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Hence, sum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>97</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>97</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>832</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
}